{"title": "未知", "index": 316, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre41\" id=\"7CGBG0-04c48e1656b54934b628efd52e257c4d\">\n<h3 class=\"chapter-three\">献词</h3>\n<p class=\"ch\">敬献给</p>\n<p class=\"juzhong\">最尊贵、最强大的国王和君主</p>\n<p class=\"juzhong\">普鲁士国王</p>\n<p class=\"juzhong\">勃兰登堡侯爵</p>\n<p class=\"juzhong\">神圣罗马帝国大臣和选帝侯</p>\n<p class=\"juzhong\">西里西亚君王和大公爵</p>\n<p class=\"juzhong\">等等、等等、等等</p>\n<p class=\"juzhong\">我最仁慈的国王和君主</p>\n<p class=\"juzhong\">弗里德里希陛下</p>\n</body>"}]}